Next](https://www.educationnext.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/logo-2.png)\n![](/
wp-content/uploads/2019/12/stacked-logo.png)\n\n# From a Half-Century-Old Novel, 
Wisdom about Teaching and Education Reform, with 2020 Political 
