reference entry and discourages representing the same source in multiple slightly
different forms. The page discusses different systems such as author–date 
(Harvard) and full-footnote styles and when to use general references versus 
specific references. For online sources, it recommends including elements like 
author, title, website name, publication or last updated date, access date, and a
